## Backend chat pipeline

app/Http/Controllers/ChatController.php — Main chat controller
  — props/params: receives messages, page_context from Inertia request; hooks: sessionCacheKey, pageContextCacheKey, faqStateCacheKey, loadSession, saveSession, clearSession, getServerPageContext, getFaqState, saveFaqState, clearFaqState; exports: chat() (POST /chat), stream() (POST /chat/stream), getSession(), newSession(), testCsrf(), models(), latestRequests(), rulesList(), facilitiesList(), equipmentList(), uploadFile(), createRequestApi()

  — Session cache keys (TTL: 15 min = SESSION_TTL_MINUTES):
    - chat_session_v2_{user_id} — stores last 10 messages per session
    - chat_page_context_{user_id} — cached page context with fingerprint
    - chat_faq_state_v2_{user_id} — FAQ state during clarification flow

  — Cache TTL: 15 minutes (SESSION_TTL_MINUTES private constant)

  — AI provider: OpenRouterClient (class name) but configured provider is NVIDIA (config/ai.php: provider => 'nvidia', model => 'nvidia_nim/nvidia/nemotron-3.5-lightning-30b-a3b')

  — Tools available to AI: get_page_context, get_request_details, check_facility_availability, get_suggested_alternatives, get_my_permissions, suggest_navigation

  — Cache keys referenced in frontend:
    - chat_session_{user_id}
    - chat_faq_state_{user_id}
    - 15-minute TTL

app/Services/AI/OpenRouterClient.php — AI client class
  — props/params: config from config/ai.php (provider, model, api_key, base_url); hooks: chat(), chatWithTools(), chatResponse(), streamChat(), providerName(), model(), baseUrl(), apiKey(), isConfigured(), buildChatPayload(), doChatRequest(), extractToolCalls(); exports: configured model nvidia_nim/nvidia/nemotron-3.5-lightning-30b-a3b, provider NVIDIA, endpoint https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1, chat template kwargs for thinking enabled

app/Services/RAG/FaqMatchingService.php — FAQ matching service
  — props/params: config from ai.faq.*; hooks: match(), retrieveCandidates(), suggestNearMatch(), findByQuestion(); exports: lexical/semantic FAQ matching, rule-based answers

